1
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:11,622
This is Toki: a soft, twenty-six-centimetre plush that helps children aged three to six practise speaking.

2
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,913
It listens, it sees, and it talks back.

3
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:22,696
A camera looks out through the pupil of its left eye, a speaker sits behind its smile, and its cheeks glow with its mood.

4
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:35,031
Take away the fabric and the stuffing, and every hard part is in one sealed pod: flame-retardant, gasketed, and closed with six security screws, with ten millimetres of stuffing all round.

5
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:44,174
Inside: an ESP32-S3 controller, a camera, a microphone, an amplifier and speaker, two cheek lights, and the battery.

6
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:49,918
The cell sits in its own screwed bay, behind two layers of protection and a fuse.

7
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:56,034
The switch and the charging port are reached through a zip in the bottom panel: nothing hard on the outside.

8
00:00:56,230 --> 00:01:01,831
Toki is switched off. Every hard part sits in one sealed pod inside the stuffing.

9
00:01:02,030 --> 00:01:06,037
The switch, under a zip in its bottom panel, turns it on.

10
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:11,005
Power flows from the cell in its screwed bay to the protected charger,

11
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,804
through the switch,

12
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,094
to the hub board, through a fuse onto the battery bus,

13
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:21,349
which feeds the XIAO, the amplifier and the cheek lights.

14
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:25,531
Two RGB LEDs wake behind acrylic light pipes,

15
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:28,640
and Toki's cheeks glow with its mood.

16
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:32,658
TOKI: Hi! I'm Toki. What's your name?

17
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:38,148
An I²S amplifier drives the 3 W speaker behind its mouth.

18
00:01:38,350 --> 00:01:39,484
CHILD: Rara!

19
00:01:40,950 --> 00:01:47,569
The microphone's sound goes through the XIAO ESP32-S3 to the backend over Wi-Fi.

20
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:50,027
TOKI: Hello, Rara! Show me something!

21
00:01:50,770 --> 00:01:52,191
CHILD: Look, Toki!

22
00:01:53,370 --> 00:01:57,116
The camera looks out through the pupil of Toki's left eye.

23
00:01:57,320 --> 00:02:03,521
The image runs from the sealed lens turret over a flex to the XIAO, and on over Wi-Fi.

24
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:08,432
On the backend: speech recognition, computer vision and a language model.

25
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:13,395
The answer comes back as speech: I²S, amplifier, speaker.

26
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:16,265
TOKI: An apple! Can you say “apple”?

27
00:02:16,990 --> 00:02:18,045
CHILD: Appo!

28
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:24,637
TOKI: Almost! Listen: apple. Your turn!

29
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,974
CHILD: Apple!

30
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:30,528
TOKI: Great job! You said “apple”!

31
00:02:31,340 --> 00:02:34,093
TOKI: Bye-bye, Rara! Let's play again tomorrow.

32
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:39,784
Off again. The cell charges through the USB-C port under the zip, with the switch off.

33
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:48,241
Toki: a friendly face for speech practice, with a sealed, child-safe heart.
